<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia KFC 1996 net up 50.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia KFC 1996 net up 50.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  51.70   vs	  34.45</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 28.0    vs	  20.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   705.35   vs	 549.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    83.87   vs	  57.22</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  6.10   vs  less   4.76</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	 12.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is KFC Holdings (Malaysia) Bhd. It operates fast-food restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
